{"unit":7,"no":27,"title":"Packing for a trip together","blurb":"Unit 7","VOCAB":[["tent","","палатка","шатыр",""],["sleeping bag","","спальный мешок","ұйықтайтын қап",""],["stove","","горелка","жорық пеші",""],["torch","","фонарик","қол шам",""],["compass","","компас","компас",""],["first-aid kit","","аптечка","дәрі қобдишасы",""],["lighter","","зажигалка","оттық",""],["cooking equipment","","посуда для готовки","ас әзірлеу құралдары",""],["map","","карта","карта",""],["take","","брать","алу",""],["need","","нуждаться","қажет ету",""],["decide","","решать","шешу",""],["choose","","выбирать","таңдау",""],["agree","","соглашаться","келісу",""]],"SLIDES":[["🧭","I think a compass is better than a GPS."]],"PICWORDS":["tent","sleeping bag","stove","torch","compass","first-aid kit","lighter","cooking equipment","map","take","need","decide","choose","agree"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"10_15":"A1_L27_10_15.mp3","10_14":"A1_L27_10_14.mp3"},"SEGS":{"10_15":[3.51,null],"10_14":[3.73,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>Packing for a trip together</h2>\n      <p>Say what you prefer, explain why — and agree and disagree politely.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes, top to bottom.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>After each <b>Check answers</b>, read the note — that is your teacher.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Three days in the mountains. One small bag. What goes in?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap your top THREE.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>🔦</b> &nbsp;a torch</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🧭</b> &nbsp;a compass</div><div class=\"card\"><b>📱</b> &nbsp;a power bank</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🍫</b> &nbsp;chocolate</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🩹</b> &nbsp;a first-aid kit</div><div class=\"card\"><b>📖</b> &nbsp;a book</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">These are your trip words for this lesson.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap 🔊 to listen. Turn on translations only if you need them.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Recall\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Recall</div>\n      <h2>Recall</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Choose the correct word.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s3SSt1\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">You sleep in it in the forest.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a stove</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a tent</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an stove</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">You sleep IN it inside the tent.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a sleeping bag</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a compass</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an sleeping bag</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">It shows you north and south.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a lighter</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an compass</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a compass</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">You cook on it.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a stove</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a torch</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an stove</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">You need it when someone is hurt.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a first-aid kit</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a map</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an first-aid kit</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">It gives you light at night.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a tent</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an torch</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a torch</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>tent · sleeping bag · compass · stove · first-aid kit · torch.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Match each thing to its job.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Tap a thing, then tap its job.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\"><b>Thing</b> &rarr; <b>Its job</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s3GRt3\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>tent</b> <select data-answer=\"you sleep in it\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>compass</b> <select data-answer=\"it shows you north\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>stove</b> <select data-answer=\"you cook on it\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>torch</b> <select data-answer=\"light at night\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>first-aid kit</b> <select data-answer=\"when someone is hurt\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>lighter</b> <select data-answer=\"it starts a fire\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Match each thing to its job.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Tap a thing, then tap its job.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\"><b>Thing</b> &rarr; <b>Its job</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s3OOt5\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>tent</b> <select data-answer=\"you sleep in it\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>compass</b> <select data-answer=\"it shows you north\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>stove</b> <select data-answer=\"you cook on it\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>torch</b> <select data-answer=\"light at night\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>first-aid kit</b> <select data-answer=\"when someone is hurt\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>lighter</b> <select data-answer=\"it starts a fire\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"you sleep in it\">you sleep in it</option><option value=\"it shows you north\">it shows you north</option><option value=\"you cook on it\">you cook on it</option><option value=\"light at night\">light at night</option><option value=\"when someone is hurt\">when someone is hurt</option><option value=\"it starts a fire\">it starts a fire</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">I'd prefer to… — and how to disagree politely.</div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('10_15',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 10.15 — the preference phrase bank</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 I think a compass is better than a GPS. 2 I'd prefer to stay in a hotel. 3 The most important thing to take is food. 4 I think we should take only one torch. 5 Taking a first aid kit is more important than taking a knife. 6 I'd prefer to have my own tent.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>“<b>I'd prefer to</b> take the GPS.”</div><div>“<b>I think</b> a lighter <b>is more important than</b> a stove.”</div><div>“<b>I'm sorry, but I don't agree</b> — what happens if it rains?”</div><div>“It gets dark late, <b>so</b> I don't think we need the torch.”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Notice:</span> nobody says just “No!”. How do the speakers disagree?</p></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:18px;overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"gtable\"><tbody><tr><th>You want to…</th><th>Say</th><th>Example</th></tr><tr><td>say your preference</td><td class=\"pos\">I'd prefer to…</td><td><b>I'd prefer to</b> take the GPS.</td></tr><tr><td>give your opinion</td><td class=\"pos\">I think… is better than…</td><td><b>I think</b> a compass <b>is better than</b> a GPS.</td></tr><tr><td>name the number one</td><td class=\"pos\">The most important thing is…</td><td><b>The most important thing</b> to take <b>is</b> food.</td></tr><tr><td>agree / disagree politely</td><td class=\"pos\">Good idea. / I'm sorry, but I don't agree.</td><td><b>I'm sorry, but I don't agree.</b> A stove is a better idea.</td></tr><tr><td>give a reason / result</td><td class=\"pos\">because / so</td><td>…<b>because</b> a GPS can break. · It rains a lot, <b>so</b> take the stove.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>I'd prefer to + verb</b>: I'd prefer to stay in a hotel.</div><div>Reasons with <b>because</b>, results with <b>so</b>.</div><div>Disagree politely: “I'm sorry, but I don't agree” — then give your reason.</div><div>Your comparatives and superlatives do the arguing: better than, the most important.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Practice\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Practice</div>\n      <h2>Practice</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 — Complete each sentence.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s5t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I'd prefer ___ take the stove.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">for</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">to</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">What happens ___ it rains?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">so</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">if</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">to</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">We can make a fire, ___ we don't need a stove.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">because</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">so</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">but</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">I don't agree, ___ a GPS can break.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">so</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">because</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">but</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">A first-aid kit is ___ important than a knife.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">most</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">more</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">many</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">I'm sorry, but I don't ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">prefer</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">agree</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>prefer <b>to</b> · if it rains · result → <b>so</b> · reason → <b>because</b> · more important than · I don't agree.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s5t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I'd prefer take my own tent.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I'd prefer taking take my own tent.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I'd prefer to take my own tent.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I'd prefer tos take my own tent.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I no agree with you.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I not agree with you.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I don't agree with you.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I doesn't agree with you.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “The most important thing are food.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">The most important thing is food.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">The most important things is food.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">The most important things are food.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>prefer <b>to</b> take · I <b>don't</b> agree · the most important thing <b>is</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s5t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">A map is ___ than a GPS if the battery dies.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">better</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the best</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the most good</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">The ___ important thing is water.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">more</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">most</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">many</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Taking a stove is a ___ idea than making a fire.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">best</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">most</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">better</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>two things → better than · number one → the most important.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Listen\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Listen</div>\n      <h2>Listen</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Three friends pack for a camping trip — and argue politely.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">This is your model. Listen once. Then answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('10_14',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 10.14 — the packing discussion</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">A: OK, so we can take a tent and sleeping bag each, and we need to decide on the five most important things to take as well. T: We need cooking equipment — we have to eat — but I think we should take one stove instead of three, because we don't need one each. A: I think a lighter is more important than a stove, because we can make a fire with wood from the forest. Z: I'm sorry, but I don't agree. Taking a stove is a better idea than making a fire — what happens if it rains? If we have the lighter and the stove, we can cook inside the tent. A: OK, so a stove, lighter and cooking equipment makes three things. We can have two more. Z: We need to find our way to the camp. I think a map and compass are the most useful things, because a GPS could break or run out of battery. A: But that's two more things. What happens if we need the first-aid kit? I'd prefer to take the GPS instead of the map and compass — then we can have the first-aid kit. T: But what about the torch? I don't like the forest at night! A: It gets dark quite late, and we should go to bed early after a long day walking. So I don't think we need the torch. Z: OK, let's take the GPS and the first-aid kit. T: OK. A: Good idea.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s6t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How many important things can they take (plus tents and sleeping bags)?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Five</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Three</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Ten</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Why one stove instead of three?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Stoves are expensive.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">They don't need one each.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">They doesn't need one each.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Why is the stove better than a fire?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Fires are boring.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">If it rains, they can cook inside the tent.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">If it rains, they cans cook inside the tent.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">What do they choose instead of the map and compass?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">The GPS and the first-aid kit</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">The torch and the knife</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Five</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">Why don't they take the torch?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">It's too heavy.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">It've too heavy.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">It gets dark late and they'll sleep early.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Five things · one stove for all · rain → cook inside · GPS + first-aid kit · dark late + early nights = no torch.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">A three-day mountain trip. Choose YOUR five things — and defend them.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">Write your list with a reason for each choice.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>The most important thing is…</li><li>I'd prefer to take…</li><li>… is better than … because…</li><li>What happens if…?</li><li>…, so…</li><li>I don't need…</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Five things, two people, one bag.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Each person knows only their own list. Then swap scenarios.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>I'd prefer to take…</li><li>I think … is better than…</li><li>The most important thing is…</li><li>I'm sorry, but I don't agree.</li><li>What happens if…?</li><li>OK, good idea.</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Five things, two people, one bag.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Each person knows only their own list. Then swap scenarios.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>I'd prefer to take…</li><li>I think … is better than…</li><li>The most important thing is…</li><li>I'm sorry, but I don't agree.</li><li>What happens if…?</li><li>OK, good idea.</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Round 1 — the mountains.</b> Each of you secretly chooses your three must-have things (stove, torch, compass, first-aid kit, lighter, map, GPS, chocolate…). Then agree on FIVE together. Use the phrases — no simple “no!”.</div><div><b>Round 2 — the beach.</b> Swap who starts. New secret lists, five new things.</div><div>The second run is where the language sticks.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Round 1 — the mountains.</b> Each of you secretly chooses your three must-have things (stove, torch, compass, first-aid kit, lighter, map, GPS, chocolate…). Then agree on FIVE together. Use the phrases — no simple “no!”.</div><div><b>Round 2 — the beach.</b> Swap who starts. New secret lists, five new things.</div><div>The second run is where the language sticks.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s8t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I'd ___ to stay at home tonight.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"prefer\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ with you \\u2014 the train is better.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"agree\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">What about ___ by train? (go)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"going\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>I'd prefer TO + verb \\u00b7 I agree (no 'am') \\u00b7 What about + -ing?</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s8t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I prefer stay at home.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I'd prefer to stay at home.|I prefer to stay at home.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">I am agree.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I agree.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">What about go by train?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"What about going by train?\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>I'd prefer TO + verb \\u00b7 I agree (no 'am') \\u00b7 What about + -ing?</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l27s8t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Suggest it: take the bus<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Why don't we take the bus?|Let's take the bus.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Disagree politely.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I'm sorry, but I don't agree.|Sorry, but I don't agree.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Say your preference: walk<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I'd prefer to walk.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>I'd prefer TO + verb \\u00b7 I agree (no 'am') \\u00b7 What about + -ing?</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}